/T ( a Single Page Application \(SPA\) designed to support farmers by providing real-time agricultural assistance through features like live chat, notifications, and dynamic updates. The platform allows farmers to consult agricultural experts about concerns related to crops, pests, soil management, and farming techniques. It also includes an AI-powered chat assistant that can instantly answer simple or common questions, while more complex concerns can be directed to human agricultural experts for further guidance.)
/E ( a Single Page Application \(SPA\) designed to support farmers by providing real-time agricultural assistance through features like live chat, notifications, and dynamic updates. The platform allows farmers to consult agricultural experts about concerns related to crops, pests, soil management, and farming techniques. It also includes an AI-powered chat assistant that can instantly answer simple or common questions, while more complex concerns can be directed to human agricultural experts for further guidance.)
