/P 58 0 R
/E (WeAgri was developed as an integrated web-based agricultural assistance platform that combines consultation management, AI support, farm monitoring, and communication tools in one system. The updated version uses a PHP-based application with JavaScript-driven frontend behavior, MySQL as the main database, and local JSON storage as a fallback when live database services are unavailable. The system was designed to support both consultation workflows and dashboard-based farm monitoring, making it more than a simple messaging platform.)
